Let customers call you from your website 

== Description ==

Extend Business lets customers call you from your website. Set up a call center in as little as a minute! No quirky phone numbers, no complicated setups. Engage users/customers and get more leads by allowing them call you from your website.

This plugin installs Extend Business Plugin across your Wordpress pages. You must setup your Extend Business account on https://extendapp.io before you can use this plugin

For more information visit https://extendapp.io


For help or support contact us via hi@extendapp.io

== Installation ==

1. Upload the plugin files to the `/wp-content/plugins/plugin-name` directory, or install the plugin through the WordPress plugins screen directly.
2. Activate the plugin through the 'Plugins' screen in WordPress
3. Use the Settings->Extend Business screen to configure the plugin


== Frequently Asked Questions ==

= How do I receive calls? =

From your dashboard, invite agents who will be able to take calls on behalf of your company. They can take calls with either android/ios apps or windows/mac apps for desktop. Links to apps are here: https://extendapp.io/downloads

= What is the pricing? =

Go to https://extendapp.io/pricing to learn about our pricing

